  "name": "TiinyEngineer",
  "pitch": "An on-call engineer that sits beside your Tiiny and tells you what broke.",
  "description": "TiinyEngineer watches the things that fail quietly: a site that stops answering, a container that never came back, a backup that went stale, a scheduled job that just stopped running. When something breaks you get one plain message that says what broke, since when, what it probably means and what to check first, and the same incident closes itself when the thing comes back. Everything stays on your own network in one local database.",
